			"notes": "NEW - \n/scanfornicks - This command scans all the players in your lobby to check if they're nicked. It is limited to 20 (togglable) and is recommended to scan when a game is about to start. (or else it could scan npcs) \n![image](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/rZiwXEaU/images/bd6107c3736541752b9ef42d2fb31a9e961d6a2c.png)\n\nCHANGE - \nThe old FileReader Config has been removed and replaced with OneConfig. You can turn on and off features by pressing R-SHIFT and doing it in OneConfig instead of commands. #42 \nRequests to Minecraft's Api have been optimized a bit. \n![image](https://github.com/udu3324/Hytools/assets/47045986/21d9a2c6-7565-4d6f-8f52-22f011c1a80e)"
		},
